ects.png" class="- topic/image "/> Edit objects</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">Opens the device’s database record for updating.</entry></row><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry "><image scale="65" width="30" href="../graphic/ExpandPane.png" class="- topic/image "/> Expand and collapse discovery pane </entry><?Pub Caret 2?><entry class="- topic/entry ">Expands and collapses the objects in the database.</entry></row><row class="- topic/row "><entry class="- topic/entry "><image scale="65" scope="local" width="30" href="../graphic/StartDiscoveryProcess.png" class="- topic/image "/> Start the discovery process</entry><entry class="- topic/entry ">Runs a discover job to locate installed devices, which appear
